<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in June 25 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in June 25 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JUNE 25</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............818,700 up.....1,200</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......721,700 up.....1,700</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......584,600 up.....7,600</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....871,901 down...2,527</p>
<p> Financial companies.......674,375 up.....2,828</p>
<p> New York business loans....45,870 down.....644</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......45,599 down.....649</p>
</text>
